Daśaratha commands Vasiṣṭha to impose fast --- Vasiṣṭha drives through three courts to Rāma house --- Rāma honors priest lifting him from chariot --- Vasiṣṭha lays mantra fast on Rāma and Sītā --- Rāma dismisses friends amid rejoicing house --- Vasiṣṭha finds royal roads jammed roaring with joy --- Swept flagged Ayōdhyā awaits sunrise crowning --- Vasiṣṭha parts crowd reporting task done --- Daśaratha dismisses crowds entering women-crowded palace like moon
